                    "id": "levelled_description_615659129b72",
                    "level": {
                      "value": 1
                    },
                    "description": {
                      "value": "You can flare your neck frill and flex your dorsal spines, Demoralizing your foes. When you do, Demoralize loses the auditory trait and gains the visual trait, and you don't take a penalty when you attempt to Demoralize a creature that doesn't understand your language. You also gain the Threatening Approach action.\n\n**Threatening Approach**\n\n- **Activate:** 2 Actions\n\nYou Stride to be adjacent to a foe and Demoralize that foe. If you succeed, the foe is frightened 2 instead of frightened 1."
                    }
                  }
                }
